From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Reduce remaining million-instruction functional inputs
Purpose: Keeps twelve workloads below one million retirements without removing their algorithms or checks.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Reduce dimensions, samples, or search prefixes rather than compiler optimization
or correctness checks. Preserve full frames, complete solutions, depth-two
minimax, and the independent NTT convolution and membership references.
Upstream sources and reference hashes remain unchanged; native host output
calibrates the replacement hashes owned by the Rhodium builder.

